{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0000", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "中国证监会行政处罚裁量基本规则", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0001", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第一条 为了规范中国证券监督管理委员会（以下简称中国\n证监会）及其派出机构的行政处罚裁量工作，统一执法尺度，保\n护公民、法人或者其他组织的合法权益，促进资本市场健康发展，\n根据《中华人民共和国行政处罚法》《中华人民共和国证券法》\n《中华人民共和国证券投资基金法》《中华人民共和国期货和衍\n生品法》等法律、行政法规，制定本规则。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0002", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第二条 本规则所称行政处罚裁量，是指中国证监会及其派\n出机构在实施行政处罚时，根据法律、行政法规和规章的规定，\n决定是否给予处罚、给予处罚的种类和幅度的裁度、衡量过程。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0003", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第三条 行政处罚裁量应当以事实为依据，与违法行为的事\n实、性质、情节、社会危害程度以及当事人主观过错程度相当。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0004", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第四条 行政处罚裁量应当综合考虑资本市场发展和投资\n者保护等因素，确保处罚必要、适当，并符合社会公序良俗和公\n众合理期待。对同一时期类别、性质、情节相似的案件，处理结\n果应当基本均衡。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0005", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 1, "text": "第五条 行政处罚裁量分为不予处罚、免予处罚、减轻处罚、\n从轻处罚、一般处罚、从重处罚等裁量阶次。\n减轻处罚，是指在法律、行政法规、规章规定的处罚幅度以\n1", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第五条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0006", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "下进行处罚，或者减少并处的处罚种类。\n从轻处罚，是指在法律、行政法规、规章规定的处罚幅度以\n内，给予较轻的处罚。\n从重处罚，是指在法律、行政法规、规章规定的处罚幅度以\n内，给予较重的处罚。\n一般处罚，是指除不予处罚、免予处罚、减轻处罚外，不存\n在本规则规定的从轻或者从重处罚情形的，在法律、行政法规、\n规章规定的处罚幅度以内，给予适中的处罚。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0007", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "第六条 对罚款有一定幅度的，在法律、行政法规、规章规\n定的处罚幅度以内，划分从轻处罚、一般处罚、从重处罚等裁量\n阶次：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第六条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0008", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "（一）从轻处罚阶次，在法定最低罚款金额以上（没有法定\n最低罚款金额的除外）、法定最高罚款金额 30%以下给予罚款；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0009", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "（二）一般处罚阶次，在法定最高罚款金额 30%以上、60%\n以下给予罚款；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0010", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 2, "text": "（三）从重处罚阶次，在法定最高罚款金额 60%以上、法定\n最高罚款金额以下给予罚款。\n在确定裁量阶次时，根据不同违法行为类型的性质、构成、\n特点等情况，可以以前款规定的百分比为基础上下浮动十个百分\n点。\n对依法应当采取证券、期货市场禁入措施、暂停或者撤销相\n关业务许可、给予买卖证券等值以下罚款等行政处罚种类的，参\n2", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0011", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "照前两款规定的原则划分裁量阶次。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0012", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第七条 有下列情形之一的，不予处罚：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0013", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（一）违法行为轻微并及时改正，没有造成危害后果；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0014", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（二）当事人有证据足以证明没有主观过错，但是法律、行\n政法规另有规定的除外；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0015", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（三）其他依法不予处罚的情形。\n初次违法且危害后果轻微并及时改正的，可以不予处罚。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0016", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第八条 违法的自然人死亡，或者违法的单位被撤销、注销\n的，免予处罚。违法的单位被撤销、注销的，违法行为的直接负\n责的主管人员和其他直接责任人员仍承担行政法律责任。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0017", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第九条 有下列情形之一的，减轻处罚：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0018", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（一）主动采取补救措施，消除违法行为危害后果；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0019", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（二）受他人严重胁迫或者严重诱骗实施违法行为；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0020", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（三）单位违法的直接负责的主管人员和其他直接责任人员\n在案发前主动举报单位违法行为，并且积极配合查处；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0021", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（四）配合查处违法行为有重大立功表现；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0022", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（五）其他依法减轻处罚的情形。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0023", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第十条 有下列情形之一的，从轻处罚：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0024", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（一）主动减轻违法行为危害后果；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0025", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（二）受他人胁迫或者诱骗实施违法行为；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0026", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（三）主动供述监管机构尚未掌握的违法行为；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0027", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "（四）配合查处违法行为有立功表现；\n3", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0028", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 3, "text": "第八条 违法的自然人死亡，或者违法的单位被撤销、注销\n的，免予处罚。违法的单位被撤销、注销的，违法行为的直接负\n责的主管人员和其他直接责任人员仍承担行政法律责任。", "is_table": true, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0029", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（五）其他依法从轻处罚的情形。\n有下列情形之一的，可以从轻处罚：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0030", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（一）对资本市场秩序影响较小；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0031", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（二）对资本市场投资者、交易者权益损害较小；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0032", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（三）主观过错较小；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0033", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（四）如实陈述，积极配合查处；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0034", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（五）对违法事实没有异议，签署认错认罚具结书；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0035", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（六）其他依法可以从轻处罚的情形。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0036", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "第十一条 有下列情形之一的，从重处罚：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0037", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（一）严重违反市场公开公平公正原则，影响资本市场秩序\n稳定，可能引发金融风险、严重危害金融安全；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0038", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（二）严重损害资本市场投资者、交易者权益，影响恶劣；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0039", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（三）实施违法行为，涉及行贿或者受贿情形；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0040", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（四）殴打、围攻、推搡、抓挠执法人员，造成执法人员人\n身损害，或者限制执法人员人身自由；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0041", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（五）毁损、伪造、篡改证据材料；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0042", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（六）转移、变卖、毁损、隐藏被依法冻结、查封、扣押、\n封存的资金或涉案财产；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0043", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（七）因证券、期货违法行为受到行政处罚或者刑事处罚后\n五年内，再次实施同一类型违法行为；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0044", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 4, "text": "（八）其他依法从重处罚的情形。\n有下列情形之一的，可以从重处罚：\n4", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0045", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "（一）违法持续时间长，涉及面广，社会危害较大；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0046", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "（二）主观过错较大；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0047", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "（三）侮辱、谩骂执法人员；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0048", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "（四）抢夺、毁损执法装备及执法人员个人物品；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0049", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "（五）抢夺、隐藏证据材料；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0050", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "（六）未按照要求提供涉案文件资料，且无正当理由；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0051", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "（七）躲避推脱、拒不接受、无故离开等不配合执法人员询\n问，或在询问时故意提供虚假陈述、谎报案情；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0052", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "（八）其他依法可以从重处罚的情形。\n当事人因", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0053", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第一款", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0054", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第四项至", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0055", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第六项、", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0056", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第二款", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0057", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第三项至", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0058", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第七项所\n涉行为已被中国证监会或其派出机构行政处罚的，该行为不再作\n为从重处罚情节。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0059", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十二条 当事人同时具有从轻、减轻或者从重处罚情节\n的，应当结合案件具体情况综合考虑后进行处罚。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十二条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0060", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十三条 当事人有违法所得，除依法应当退赔的外，应当\n予以没收。证券期货违法行为的违法所得，是指通过违法行为所\n获利益或者避免的损失，应根据违法行为的不同性质予以认定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0061", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十四条 两个以上当事人共同实施违法行为的，应当将所\n有当事人作为一个整体，认定主观过错、违法行为和违法所得。\n但是，法律、行政法规、规章另有规定的，从其规定。\n5", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0062", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 5, "text": "第十二条 当事人同时具有从轻、减轻或者从重处罚情节\n的，应当结合案件具体情况综合考虑后进行处罚。\n第十三条 当事人有违法所得，除依法应当退赔的外，应当\n予以没收。证券期货违法行为的违法所得，是指通过违法行为所\n获利益或者避免的损失，应根据违法行为的不同性质予以认定。\n第十四条 两个以上当事人共同实施违法行为的，应当将所\n有当事人作为一个整体，认定主观过错、违法行为和违法所得。\n但是，法律、行政法规、规章另有规定的，从其规定。", "is_table": true, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十二条", "第十三条", "第十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0063", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十五条 认定构成共同违法，依法给予没收违法所得、罚\n款等处罚的，应当在处罚决定书中明确各当事人承担没收违法所\n得、罚款的金额。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十五条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0064", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十六条 单位实施违法行为的，对直接负责的主管人员和\n其他直接责任人员的处罚，从以下方面考虑该人员与案件认定的\n事实、性质、情节、社会危害程度之间的关系，综合分析认定：", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十六条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0065", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "（一）在违法行为中所起的作用；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0066", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "（二）职务及履行职责情况；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0067", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "（三）知情程度；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0068", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "（四）知情后采取的行动；", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0069", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "（五）其他影响责任认定的情节。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0070", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十七条 中国证监会及其派出机构认定当事人有多个独\n立违法行为，均给予罚款的，罚款数额累计计算。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0071", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十八条 实施行政处罚，适用违法行为发生时的法律、行\n政法规、规章的规定。\n作出行政处罚决定时，法律、行政法规、规章已修改或者废\n止，且新的规定处罚较轻或者不认为是违法的，适用新的规定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十八条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0072", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十九条 违法行为始于法律、行政法规、规章修改生效之\n前，终于修改生效之后的，适用新的规定进行处罚。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0073", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第二十条 对情节复杂或者重大违法行为给予行政处罚的，\n中国证监会或其派出机构负责人应当集体讨论决定。\n适用本规则可能出现明显不当、显失公平，或者本规则适用\n6", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0074", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十五条 认定构成共同违法，依法给予没收违法所得、罚\n款等处罚的，应当在处罚决定书中明确各当事人承担没收违法所\n得、罚款的金额。", "is_table": true, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十五条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0075", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十七条 中国证监会及其派出机构认定当事人有多个独\n立违法行为，均给予罚款的，罚款数额累计计算。", "is_table": true, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十七条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0076", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 6, "text": "第十九条 违法行为始于法律、行政法规、规章修改生效之\n前，终于修改生效之后的，适用新的规定进行处罚。", "is_table": true, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第十九条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0077", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "的客观情况发生变化，需要调整适用的，应当经中国证监会主要\n负责人批准或者集体讨论决定。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0078", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十一条 对违法行为涉嫌犯罪的，应当依照规定及时移\n送司法机关，依法追究刑事责任。对违法行为同时构成民事侵权\n的，依法配合做好民事责任追究。\n依法不予处罚的，可以根据情节采取相应的行政监管措施并\n记入证券期货市场诚信档案、通知自律组织依法采取纪律处分等\n自律管理措施。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十一条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0079", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十二条 违法行为涉嫌犯罪，移送司法机关时已给予没\n收违法所得、罚款的，移送文书中应当写明没收违法所得、缴纳\n罚款情况。\n违法行为构成犯罪被判处罚金后，对该违法行为还需要给予\n行政处罚的，不再给予罚款。\n违法行为涉嫌犯罪，移送司法机关后，对依法不需要追究刑\n事责任或者免予刑事处罚，但应当给予行政处罚的，依法进行处\n罚。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十二条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0080", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十三条 中国证监会对派出机构行使处罚权进行监督、\n指导。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0081", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十四条 本规则中下列用语的含义：\n“受他人胁迫或者诱骗”是指当事人受到他人威胁，迫于精\n神上的强制而实施违法行为，或者受到引诱、欺骗，因被蒙蔽而\n实施违法行为。\n7", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十四条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0082", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 7, "text": "第二十三条 中国证监会对派出机构行使处罚权进行监督、\n指导。", "is_table": true, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十三条"]}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0083", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "“受他人严重胁迫或者严重诱骗”是指当事人的人身权利、\n财产权利以及其他合法权益受到严重威胁，或者被引诱、欺骗而\n产生重大认识错误，导致违法行为发生。\n“立功”是指检举、揭发他人违法犯罪行为或者提供查处其\n他案件的重要线索，经查证属实。\n“重大立功”是指检举、揭发他人重大违法犯罪行为或者提\n供查处其他重大案件的重要线索，经查证属实。", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": []}
{"doc_id": "csrc_0010_att1", "chunk_id": "csrc_0010_att1::c0084", "domain": "regulatory", "page": 8, "text": "第二十五条 本规则自 2025 年 3 月 1 日起施行。\n8", "is_table": false, "section_title": "", "clauses": ["第二十五条"]}
